# rl2 top-face flux series [m/s], negative = infiltration (the b3 sign
# convention): -8e-7 for the first 1800 s of every 3600 s, 1 s ramps.
# The rate sits below the silt Ksat (1e-6 m/s) so the top cells
# approach saturation without a forced oversaturation the box cannot
# transmit (first-execution finding: a 2e-5 pulse lost 89 % of T as
# vloss/realloc_dropped in BOTH modes).
0 -8.0e-7
1799 -8.0e-7
1800 0.0
3599 0.0
3600 -8.0e-7
5399 -8.0e-7
5400 0.0
7199 0.0
7200 -8.0e-7
8999 -8.0e-7
9000 0.0
10799 0.0
10800 -8.0e-7
12599 -8.0e-7
12600 0.0
14399 0.0
14400 0.0
